{"track":"est2","num":"2.01","title":"Functions: Composite, Inverse & Logarithmic","sections":[{"heading":"Domain and range","questions":[{"q":"Find the domain of $f(x)=\\dfrac{1}{x^2-9}$.","answer":"The denominator is zero when $x=\\pm3$. Domain: all real $x$ except $x=3$ and $x=-3$."},{"q":"Find the domain of $g(x)=\\sqrt{7-2x}$.","answer":"The radicand must be non-negative: $7-2x\\geq0\\Rightarrow x\\leq\\dfrac{7}{2}$."},{"q":"Find the range of $f(x)=-(x-2)^2+5$.","answer":"Since $-(x-2)^2\\leq0$ for all $x$, $f(x)\\leq5$. Range: $f(x)\\leq5$."}]},{"heading":"Composite functions","questions":[{"q":"Given $f(x)=x^2+1$ and $g(x)=2x-3$, find $(f\\circ g)(x)$.","answer":"$f(g(x))=(2x-3)^2+1=4x^2-12x+9+1=4x^2-12x+10$."},{"q":"Given $f(x)=\\sqrt{x+4}$ and $g(x)=x^2-4$, find $(f\\circ g)(x)$.","answer":"$f(g(x))=\\sqrt{(x^2-4)+4}=\\sqrt{x^2}=|x|$."},{"q":"Using the same $f$ and $g$ as the previous question, find $(g\\circ f)(x)$ and state its domain.","answer":"$g(f(x))=\\left(\\sqrt{x+4}\\right)^2-4=(x+4)-4=x$, valid for $x\\geq-4$ (the domain of $f$)."}]},{"heading":"Inverse functions","questions":[{"q":"Find $f^{-1}(x)$ for $f(x)=\\dfrac{2x-5}{3}$.","answer":"$y=\\dfrac{2x-5}{3}\\Rightarrow3y=2x-5\\Rightarrow x=\\dfrac{3y+5}{2}$. So $f^{-1}(x)=\\dfrac{3x+5}{2}$."},{"q":"Find $f^{-1}(x)$ for $f(x)=x^3+2$.","answer":"$y=x^3+2\\Rightarrow x=\\sqrt[3]{y-2}$. So $f^{-1}(x)=\\sqrt[3]{x-2}$."}]},{"heading":"Verifying inverses","questions":[{"q":"Verify that $f(x)=5x+1$ and $g(x)=\\dfrac{x-1}{5}$ are inverses by showing $f(g(x))=x$.","answer":"$f(g(x))=5\\left(\\dfrac{x-1}{5}\\right)+1=(x-1)+1=x$. Confirmed."},{"q":"Does $f(x)=x^2$ (for all real $x$) have an inverse function? Explain.","answer":"No. $f$ is not one-to-one — it fails the horizontal line test, since for example $f(2)=f(-2)=4$. An inverse function only exists if the domain is restricted (e.g. to $x\\geq0$)."}]},{"heading":"Logarithm laws","questions":[{"q":"Expand $\\log_b\\left(\\dfrac{x^3y}{z^2}\\right)$ using the laws of logarithms.","answer":"$\\log_b\\left(\\dfrac{x^3y}{z^2}\\right)=3\\log_bx+\\log_by-2\\log_bz$."},{"q":"Condense $2\\log_5x+3\\log_5y-\\log_5z$ into a single logarithm.","answer":"$2\\log_5x+3\\log_5y-\\log_5z=\\log_5\\left(\\dfrac{x^2y^3}{z}\\right)$."},{"q":"Evaluate $\\log_2 32-\\log_2 4$ without a calculator.","answer":"$\\log_2\\left(\\dfrac{32}{4}\\right)=\\log_2 8=3$."}]},{"heading":"Solving logarithmic equations","questions":[{"q":"Solve $\\log_4(x^2)=3$.","answer":"$x^2=4^3=64\\Rightarrow x=\\pm8$. Both satisfy the domain requirement $x^2>0$. Solutions: $x=8$ or $x=-8$."},{"q":"Solve $\\ln x+\\ln(x-3)=\\ln10$.","answer":"$\\ln\\left[x(x-3)\\right]=\\ln10\\Rightarrow x^2-3x-10=0\\Rightarrow(x-5)(x+2)=0\\Rightarrow x=5$ or $x=-2$. Since $\\ln(x-3)$ requires $x>3$, reject $x=-2$. Solution: $x=5$."}]},{"heading":"Exponential equations and logs as inverses","questions":[{"q":"Solve $e^{2x-1}=20$, giving your answer to three decimal places.","answer":"$2x-1=\\ln20\\approx2.996\\Rightarrow x=\\dfrac{1+2.996}{2}\\approx1.998$."},{"q":"The functions $f(x)=\\log_3x$ and $g(x)=3^x$ are inverses. Use this fact to solve $3^x=81$ without a calculator, and state the value of $g(f(16))$.","answer":"$81=3^4$, so $x=4$. Since $f$ and $g$ are inverses, $g(f(16))=16$."}]},{"heading":"Transformations of functions","questions":[{"q":"The graph shows $f(x)=x^2$ (teal) and $g(x)=(x-2)^2+1$ (indigo). Describe the transformation that maps $f$ onto $g$.","figure":{"type":"plot","fns":["x**2","(x-2)**2+1"],"xmin":-3,"xmax":5,"ymin":-2,"ymax":10,"width":220},"answer":"$g$ is $f$ shifted right $2$ units and up $1$ unit — a horizontal translation of $+2$ followed by a vertical translation of $+1$."},{"q":"If $h(x)=-f(x+3)$ where $f(x)=x^2$, describe the transformations applied to $f$ to obtain $h$.","answer":"Shift $f$ left $3$ units (from $x+3$), then reflect the result over the $x$-axis (from the negative sign outside)."}]},{"heading":"A well-designed word problem: investment growth and doubling time","questions":[{"q":"This question has three parts. An investment fund grows according to $A(t)=A_0e^{0.045t}$, where $A_0$ is the initial amount (in dollars) and $t$ is time in years. (a) If $A_0=8000$ dollars, find $A(10)$ to the nearest dollar. (b) Find the time $t$, to the nearest tenth of a year, for the investment to double. (c) Solve for $t$ in terms of $A$ and $A_0$ — that is, find the inverse function $t(A)$.","answer":"(a) $A(10)=8000e^{0.45}\\approx8000(1.5683)\\approx12546$ dollars. (b) Doubling requires $e^{0.045t}=2\\Rightarrow0.045t=\\ln2\\Rightarrow t=\\dfrac{\\ln2}{0.045}\\approx15.4$ years. (c) From $A=A_0e^{rt}$: $\\dfrac{A}{A_0}=e^{rt}\\Rightarrow\\ln\\left(\\dfrac{A}{A_0}\\right)=rt\\Rightarrow t(A)=\\dfrac{1}{0.045}\\ln\\left(\\dfrac{A}{A_0}\\right)$."}]},{"heading":"Multiple choice — easy","questions":[{"q":"If $f(x)=-4x+7$ and $g(x)=-2x-5$, find $(f\\circ g)(7)$.","choices":["$83$","$85$","$-19$","$81$"],"correct":0,"answer":"$g(7)=-2(7)-5=-19$. $f(-19)=-4(-19)+7=83$."},{"q":"If $f(x)=-x+2$ and $g(x)=-4x+3$, find $(f\\circ g)(-1)$.","choices":["$-5$","$7$","$-3$","$-7$"],"correct":0,"answer":"$g(-1)=-4(-1)+3=7$. $f(7)=-(7)+2=-5$."},{"q":"If $f(x)=x$ and $g(x)=-3x+3$, find $(f\\circ g)(6)$.","choices":["$-13$","$-15$","$-12$","$-17$"],"correct":1,"answer":"$g(6)=-3(6)+3=-15$. $f(-15)=-15$."},{"q":"If $f(x)=x+7$ and $g(x)=-3x+9$, find $(f\\circ g)(6)$.","choices":["$0$","$-9$","$-4$","$-2$"],"correct":3,"answer":"$g(6)=-3(6)+9=-9$. $f(-9)=(-9)+7=-2$."},{"q":"If $f(x)=2x-6$ and $g(x)=-3x+1$, find $(f\\circ g)(3)$.","choices":["$-20$","$-22$","$-8$","$-24$"],"correct":1,"answer":"$g(3)=-3(3)+1=-8$. $f(-8)=2(-8)-6=-22$."},{"q":"If $f(x)=-3x+8$ and $g(x)=-4x+7$, find $(f\\circ g)(8)$.","choices":["$85$","$81$","$-25$","$83$"],"correct":3,"answer":"$g(8)=-4(8)+7=-25$. $f(-25)=-3(-25)+8=83$."},{"q":"If $f(x)=x$ and $g(x)=3x-9$, find $(f\\circ g)(4)$.","choices":["$6$","$5$","$1$","$3$"],"correct":3,"answer":"$g(4)=3(4)-9=3$. $f(3)=3$."},{"q":"If $f(x)=2x+1$ and $g(x)=-2x-7$, find $(f\\circ g)(4)$.","choices":["$-15$","$-29$","$-31$","$-27$"],"correct":1,"answer":"$g(4)=-2(4)-7=-15$. $f(-15)=2(-15)+1=-29$."},{"q":"If $f(x)=2x+7$ and $g(x)=4x+4$, find $(f\\circ g)(5)$.","choices":["$57$","$53$","$24$","$55$"],"correct":3,"answer":"$g(5)=4(5)+4=24$. $f(24)=2(24)+7=55$."},{"q":"If $f(x)=x-1$ and $g(x)=2x+4$, find $(f\\circ g)(-4)$.","choices":["$-3$","$-7$","$-4$","$-5$"],"correct":3,"answer":"$g(-4)=2(-4)+4=-4$. $f(-4)=(-4)-1=-5$."},{"q":"If $f(x)=x-8$ and $g(x)=-4x-8$, find $(f\\circ g)(1)$.","choices":["$-12$","$-18$","$-22$","$-20$"],"correct":3,"answer":"$g(1)=-4(1)-8=-12$. $f(-12)=(-12)-8=-20$."},{"q":"If $f(x)=4x+8$ and $g(x)=2x-2$, find $(f\\circ g)(-7)$.","choices":["$-56$","$-16$","$-58$","$-54$"],"correct":0,"answer":"$g(-7)=2(-7)-2=-16$. $f(-16)=4(-16)+8=-56$."},{"q":"If $f(x)=4x-6$ and $g(x)=-2x-6$, find $(f\\circ g)(-5)$.","choices":["$8$","$12$","$10$","$4$"],"correct":2,"answer":"$g(-5)=-2(-5)-6=4$. $f(4)=4(4)-6=10$."},{"q":"If $f(x)=-4x+5$ and $g(x)=2x+3$, find $(f\\circ g)(-2)$.","choices":["$11$","$7$","$-1$","$9$"],"correct":3,"answer":"$g(-2)=2(-2)+3=-1$. $f(-1)=-4(-1)+5=9$."},{"q":"If $f(x)=2x-3$ and $g(x)=-4x+2$, find $(f\\circ g)(6)$.","choices":["$-49$","$-45$","$-22$","$-47$"],"correct":3,"answer":"$g(6)=-4(6)+2=-22$. $f(-22)=2(-22)-3=-47$."}]},{"heading":"Multiple choice — medium","questions":[{"q":"Find $f^{-1}(x)$ for $f(x)=\\dfrac{6x-5}{8}$.","choices":["$\\dfrac{6x+5}{8}$","$\\dfrac{8x+5}{6}$","$\\dfrac{8x-5}{6}$","$\\dfrac{6x-5}{8}$"],"correct":1,"answer":"$y=\\dfrac{6x-5}{8}\\Rightarrow8y=6x-5\\Rightarrow x=\\dfrac{8y+5}{6}$. So $f^{-1}(x)=\\dfrac{8x+5}{6}$."},{"q":"Find $f^{-1}(x)$ for $f(x)=\\dfrac{2x-16}{5}$.","choices":["$\\dfrac{2x-16}{5}$","$\\dfrac{5x-16}{2}$","$\\dfrac{5x+16}{2}$","$\\dfrac{2x+16}{5}$"],"correct":2,"answer":"$y=\\dfrac{2x-16}{5}\\Rightarrow5y=2x-16\\Rightarrow x=\\dfrac{5y+16}{2}$. So $f^{-1}(x)=\\dfrac{5x+16}{2}$."},{"q":"Find $f^{-1}(x)$ for $f(x)=\\dfrac{8x-1}{5}$.","choices":["$\\dfrac{5x-1}{8}$","$\\dfrac{8x+1}{5}$","$\\dfrac{5x+1}{8}$","$\\dfrac{8x-1}{5}$"],"correct":2,"answer":"$y=\\dfrac{8x-1}{5}\\Rightarrow5y=8x-1\\Rightarrow x=\\dfrac{5y+1}{8}$. So $f^{-1}(x)=\\dfrac{5x+1}{8}$."},{"q":"Find $f^{-1}(x)$ for $f(x)=\\dfrac{9x-13}{4}$.","choices":["$\\dfrac{9x-13}{4}$","$\\dfrac{4x-13}{9}$","$\\dfrac{9x+13}{4}$","$\\dfrac{4x+13}{9}$"],"correct":3,"answer":"$y=\\dfrac{9x-13}{4}\\Rightarrow4y=9x-13\\Rightarrow x=\\dfrac{4y+13}{9}$. So $f^{-1}(x)=\\dfrac{4x+13}{9}$."},{"q":"Find $f^{-1}(x)$ for $f(x)=\\dfrac{3x-18}{2}$.","choices":["$\\dfrac{2x+18}{3}$","$\\dfrac{3x-18}{2}$","$\\dfrac{2x-18}{3}$","$\\dfrac{3x+18}{2}$"],"correct":0,"answer":"$y=\\dfrac{3x-18}{2}\\Rightarrow2y=3x-18\\Rightarrow x=\\dfrac{2y+18}{3}$. So $f^{-1}(x)=\\dfrac{2x+18}{3}$."},{"q":"Find $f^{-1}(x)$ for $f(x)=\\dfrac{5x-14}{3}$.","choices":["$\\dfrac{5x-14}{3}$","$\\dfrac{3x-14}{5}$","$\\dfrac{3x+14}{5}$","$\\dfrac{5x+14}{3}$"],"correct":2,"answer":"$y=\\dfrac{5x-14}{3}\\Rightarrow3y=5x-14\\Rightarrow x=\\dfrac{3y+14}{5}$. So $f^{-1}(x)=\\dfrac{3x+14}{5}$."},{"q":"Find $f^{-1}(x)$ for $f(x)=\\dfrac{2x-10}{7}$.","choices":["$\\dfrac{7x+10}{2}$","$\\dfrac{2x-10}{7}$","$\\dfrac{7x-10}{2}$","$\\dfrac{2x+10}{7}$"],"correct":0,"answer":"$y=\\dfrac{2x-10}{7}\\Rightarrow7y=2x-10\\Rightarrow x=\\dfrac{7y+10}{2}$. So $f^{-1}(x)=\\dfrac{7x+10}{2}$."},{"q":"Find $f^{-1}(x)$ for $f(x)=\\dfrac{7x-15}{4}$.","choices":["$\\dfrac{4x+15}{7}$","$\\dfrac{7x-15}{4}$","$\\dfrac{7x+15}{4}$","$\\dfrac{4x-15}{7}$"],"correct":0,"answer":"$y=\\dfrac{7x-15}{4}\\Rightarrow4y=7x-15\\Rightarrow x=\\dfrac{4y+15}{7}$. So $f^{-1}(x)=\\dfrac{4x+15}{7}$."},{"q":"Find $f^{-1}(x)$ for $f(x)=\\dfrac{6x-4}{4}$.","choices":["$\\dfrac{6x-4}{4}$","$\\dfrac{4x-4}{6}$","$\\dfrac{4x+4}{6}$","$\\dfrac{6x+4}{4}$"],"correct":2,"answer":"$y=\\dfrac{6x-4}{4}\\Rightarrow4y=6x-4\\Rightarrow x=\\dfrac{4y+4}{6}$. So $f^{-1}(x)=\\dfrac{4x+4}{6}$."},{"q":"Find $f^{-1}(x)$ for $f(x)=\\dfrac{6x-18}{4}$.","choices":["$\\dfrac{4x+18}{6}$","$\\dfrac{4x-18}{6}$","$\\dfrac{6x-18}{4}$","$\\dfrac{6x+18}{4}$"],"correct":0,"answer":"$y=\\dfrac{6x-18}{4}\\Rightarrow4y=6x-18\\Rightarrow x=\\dfrac{4y+18}{6}$. So $f^{-1}(x)=\\dfrac{4x+18}{6}$."},{"q":"Find $f^{-1}(x)$ for $f(x)=\\dfrac{5x-2}{8}$.","choices":["$\\dfrac{5x-2}{8}$","$\\dfrac{8x-2}{5}$","$\\dfrac{5x+2}{8}$","$\\dfrac{8x+2}{5}$"],"correct":3,"answer":"$y=\\dfrac{5x-2}{8}\\Rightarrow8y=5x-2\\Rightarrow x=\\dfrac{8y+2}{5}$. So $f^{-1}(x)=\\dfrac{8x+2}{5}$."},{"q":"Find $f^{-1}(x)$ for $f(x)=\\dfrac{4x-20}{2}$.","choices":["$\\dfrac{2x-20}{4}$","$\\dfrac{2x+20}{4}$","$\\dfrac{4x-20}{2}$","$\\dfrac{4x+20}{2}$"],"correct":1,"answer":"$y=\\dfrac{4x-20}{2}\\Rightarrow2y=4x-20\\Rightarrow x=\\dfrac{2y+20}{4}$. So $f^{-1}(x)=\\dfrac{2x+20}{4}$."},{"q":"Find $f^{-1}(x)$ for $f(x)=\\dfrac{2x-11}{6}$.","choices":["$\\dfrac{2x-11}{6}$","$\\dfrac{2x+11}{6}$","$\\dfrac{6x-11}{2}$","$\\dfrac{6x+11}{2}$"],"correct":3,"answer":"$y=\\dfrac{2x-11}{6}\\Rightarrow6y=2x-11\\Rightarrow x=\\dfrac{6y+11}{2}$. So $f^{-1}(x)=\\dfrac{6x+11}{2}$."},{"q":"Find $f^{-1}(x)$ for $f(x)=\\dfrac{8x-2}{5}$.","choices":["$\\dfrac{5x+2}{8}$","$\\dfrac{8x+2}{5}$","$\\dfrac{8x-2}{5}$","$\\dfrac{5x-2}{8}$"],"correct":0,"answer":"$y=\\dfrac{8x-2}{5}\\Rightarrow5y=8x-2\\Rightarrow x=\\dfrac{5y+2}{8}$. So $f^{-1}(x)=\\dfrac{5x+2}{8}$."},{"q":"Find $f^{-1}(x)$ for $f(x)=\\dfrac{6x-3}{3}$.","choices":["$\\dfrac{6x-3}{3}$","$\\dfrac{6x+3}{3}$","$\\dfrac{3x-3}{6}$","$\\dfrac{3x+3}{6}$"],"correct":3,"answer":"$y=\\dfrac{6x-3}{3}\\Rightarrow3y=6x-3\\Rightarrow x=\\dfrac{3y+3}{6}$. So $f^{-1}(x)=\\dfrac{3x+3}{6}$."}]},{"heading":"Multiple choice — hard","questions":[{"q":"Solve $\\ln x+\\ln(x-4)=\\ln140$.","choices":["$14$","$12$","$16$","$-10$"],"correct":0,"answer":"$\\ln[x(x-4)]=\\ln140\\Rightarrow x(x-4)=140\\Rightarrow x^2-4x-140=0\\Rightarrow(x-14)(x-(-10))=0\\Rightarrow x=14$ (rejecting $x=-10$ since $x>4$ is required)."},{"q":"Solve $\\ln x+\\ln(x-5)=\\ln6$.","choices":["$8$","$-1$","$4$","$6$"],"correct":3,"answer":"$\\ln[x(x-5)]=\\ln6\\Rightarrow x(x-5)=6\\Rightarrow x^2-5x-6=0\\Rightarrow(x-6)(x-(-1))=0\\Rightarrow x=6$ (rejecting $x=-1$ since $x>5$ is required)."},{"q":"Solve $\\ln x+\\ln(x-4)=\\ln77$.","choices":["$11$","$-7$","$9$","$13$"],"correct":0,"answer":"$\\ln[x(x-4)]=\\ln77\\Rightarrow x(x-4)=77\\Rightarrow x^2-4x-77=0\\Rightarrow(x-11)(x-(-7))=0\\Rightarrow x=11$ (rejecting $x=-7$ since $x>4$ is required)."},{"q":"Solve $\\ln x+\\ln(x-4)=\\ln221$.","choices":["$15$","$17$","$19$","$-13$"],"correct":1,"answer":"$\\ln[x(x-4)]=\\ln221\\Rightarrow x(x-4)=221\\Rightarrow x^2-4x-221=0\\Rightarrow(x-17)(x-(-13))=0\\Rightarrow x=17$ (rejecting $x=-13$ since $x>4$ is required)."},{"q":"Solve $\\ln x+\\ln(x-6)=\\ln247$.","choices":["$-13$","$17$","$21$","$19$"],"correct":3,"answer":"$\\ln[x(x-6)]=\\ln247\\Rightarrow x(x-6)=247\\Rightarrow x^2-6x-247=0\\Rightarrow(x-19)(x-(-13))=0\\Rightarrow x=19$ (rejecting $x=-13$ since $x>6$ is required)."},{"q":"Solve $e^{3x-9}=433$, giving your answer to three decimal places.","choices":["$5.524$","$4.524$","$6.024$","$5.024$"],"correct":3,"answer":"$3x-9=\\ln433\\approx6.071\\Rightarrow x=\\dfrac{9+6.071}{3}\\approx5.024$."},{"q":"Solve $e^{3x-7}=105$, giving your answer to three decimal places.","choices":["$3.385$","$3.885$","$4.885$","$4.385$"],"correct":1,"answer":"$3x-7=\\ln105\\approx4.654\\Rightarrow x=\\dfrac{7+4.654}{3}\\approx3.885$."},{"q":"Solve $e^{4x-9}=67$, giving your answer to three decimal places.","choices":["$2.801$","$3.301$","$3.801$","$4.301$"],"correct":1,"answer":"$4x-9=\\ln67\\approx4.205\\Rightarrow x=\\dfrac{9+4.205}{4}\\approx3.301$."},{"q":"Solve $e^{4x-6}=488$, giving your answer to three decimal places.","choices":["$4.048$","$3.548$","$3.048$","$2.548$"],"correct":2,"answer":"$4x-6=\\ln488\\approx6.190\\Rightarrow x=\\dfrac{6+6.190}{4}\\approx3.048$."},{"q":"Solve $e^{2x-8}=355$, giving your answer to three decimal places.","choices":["$6.436$","$7.936$","$6.936$","$7.436$"],"correct":2,"answer":"$2x-8=\\ln355\\approx5.872\\Rightarrow x=\\dfrac{8+5.872}{2}\\approx6.936$."},{"q":"Evaluate $\\log_{3} 648-\\log_{3} 8$ without a calculator.","choices":["$3$","$5$","$4$","$640$"],"correct":2,"answer":"$\\log_{3}\\left(\\dfrac{648}{8}\\right)=\\log_{3}81=4$."},{"q":"Evaluate $\\log_{5} 500-\\log_{5} 4$ without a calculator.","choices":["$496$","$3$","$4$","$2$"],"correct":1,"answer":"$\\log_{5}\\left(\\dfrac{500}{4}\\right)=\\log_{5}125=3$."},{"q":"Evaluate $\\log_{3} 5103-\\log_{3} 7$ without a calculator.","choices":["$7$","$5$","$5096$","$6$"],"correct":3,"answer":"$\\log_{3}\\left(\\dfrac{5103}{7}\\right)=\\log_{3}729=6$."},{"q":"Evaluate $\\log_{3} 72-\\log_{3} 8$ without a calculator.","choices":["$64$","$2$","$3$","$1$"],"correct":1,"answer":"$\\log_{3}\\left(\\dfrac{72}{8}\\right)=\\log_{3}9=2$."},{"q":"Evaluate $\\log_{2} 32-\\log_{2} 2$ without a calculator.","choices":["$30$","$3$","$4$","$5$"],"correct":2,"answer":"$\\log_{2}\\left(\\dfrac{32}{2}\\right)=\\log_{2}16=4$."}]}]}